  "checklist": [
    "Panel: 820 px wide on a near-black ground; ten expanded cards (116 apart) fit the screen with the top three steel cards and the title strip above them",
    "Title strip: Production, the three factory figures in hoi_24header (military, dockyards, repair) with their tooltips, the close button at the strip's right edge (under the top bar's alerts while a request is pending); ESCAPE closes the panel",
    "Top cards: seven materials in black insets (hoi_20b, icon at 1:1, four-digit amounts whole), the five add-line buttons (infantry, armour, aircraft, naval, naval repair) each opening its picker, the Production / Efficiency table (six figures right-aligned in hoi_20b), the twelve filters each clickable with its count",
    "A naval line, expanded: head (priority badge and arrows, the name in hoi_24header whole, manufacturer button, up to four materials in a row with 3-digit amounts inside their slots, dockyards - n +, delete), the ship picture on the plate as before, the deploy target whole beside RBM's insignia (name clear of it), the date in hoi_24header on the 266x24 bar in all three colours (green, yellow, red), the cost box (cost per unit, or empty), amount + infinity -, the slot boxes with the factory icons inside them, the next ship's name",
    "A land line, expanded (filter off the ships, or the land tab): efficiency icon and bar, need icon and 'Need: n', the date bar, x10 and x5, fifteen slots, the cost box; the plate and picture as before",
    "Collapsed lines (the expand arrow): land (bar, need), naval (bar of 180 with the date whole, - amount +, deploy target), refit and railway gun lines; the same head, the date in the same column as the expanded lines; the efficiency bar of a collapsed land line in the strip's right part",
    "Line states: selected line (2 px light steel outline), a line with a manufacturer (tint of the head band only, name readable), outdated equipment overlay, refit line, railway gun line, consumer goods line, the new-line entries (x10/x5; amount buttons)",
    "Every list scrolled to the end: the last line fully visible; the mouse wheel moves one card (116) per notch; drag and drop and the priority arrows still work",
    "The five slide-in windows (two equipment pickers, deployment, ship names, naval repair) open beside the panel at x 809-814, not under it",
    "Both states of the close button hotkey and of every factory button (- n +)"
  ],
  "_note": "C1 round 2, bold variant (2026-10-20): the panel is 820 wide, the lines 780 (cards 110 + 6, window 116; collapsed 60 + 6), the top three steel cards under a title strip.",
